  ratecode STRING OPTIONS(description="Filters data for consumed revenue, room nights, and other critical metrics based on the Ratecode. The rate code specifies the type of product or offer a guest has booked and indicates any discounts, promotions, or special rates associated with it"),
  corp_identifier STRING OPTIONS(description="Filters data for metrics like consumed revenue, room nights, and other key statistics based on the Corporate Identifier. The corporate identifier is a unique code used to identify a company within the booking system. It enables the grouping of rate codes by removing the rate identifier, allowing users to view the total production for a company. For instance, Amazon has three rate plans: B-AMAZ, N-AMAZ, and L-AMAZ. The corporate identifier for Amazon is 'AMAZ,' which is displayed in this column, making it possible to filter using a single code and consolidate metrics effectively."),
  pms_segment STRING OPTIONS(description="Filters values for consumed revenue, room nights, and other metrics based on the Market Segment. These segments are categorized by shared characteristics such as the type of rate, room type, and the booking channel used by the guest."),
  segment_code STRING OPTIONS(description="Filters values for consumed revenue, room nights, and other metrics based on the Market Segment. These segments are categorized by shared characteristics such as the type of rate, room type, and the booking channel used by the guest."),
  segment STRING OPTIONS(description="Filters values for consumed revenue, room nights, and other metrics based on the Market Segment. These segments are categorized by shared characteristics such as the type of rate, room type, and the booking channel used by the guest."),
  segment_sort STRING OPTIONS(description="Filters data for consumed revenue, room nights, and other essential metrics at a specific point in time."),
  segment_group STRING OPTIONS(description="Filters values for consumed revenue, room nights, and other key metrics according to the Market Segment Group. This group represents the broadest combination of market segments, categorized into Transient, Group, Contract, and Complimentary"),
  consortia_code STRING OPTIONS(description="Consortia refers to a group of travel agencies or travel management companies (TMCS) that collaborate to maximize their shared purchasing power and secure negotiated rates for preferred hotel programs. These programs are designed primarily for corporate and luxury leisure travel."),
  consortia STRING OPTIONS(description="Filters data for metrics like consumed revenue, room nights, and other key statistics based on the Consortia. Consorita refers to a group of travel agencies or travel management companies (TMCS) that collaborate to maximize their shared purchasing power and secure negotiated rates for preferred hotel programs. These programs are designed primarily for corporate and luxury leisure travel."),
  consortia_shortname STRING OPTIONS(description="Consortia names abbreviated within charts and graphs when space constraints prevent the display of longer names."),
  consortia_segment STRING OPTIONS(description="Filters data for metrics such as consumed revenue, room nights, and other essential statistics organized by Consortia Category, The consortia category organizes each consortia into a primary group based on the type of business, segment, and clientele they serve such as Leisure, Corproate, Government or Airline.Leisure"),
  consortia_category STRING OPTIONS(description="Filters data for metrics such as consumed revenue, room nights, and other essential statistics organized by Consortia Category, The consortia category organizes each consortia into a primary group based on the type of business, industry, and clientele they serve such as Luxury, Mid-Market, Luxury, Airline Crew or Corporate Travel."),
  agency_iata STRING OPTIONS(description="A travel agency iata number (also referred to as an iata numeric code or tids code) is a distinct 7-digit identification number assigned by the international air transport association (Iata) to certified travel agencies."),
  agency STRING OPTIONS(description="Filters the values for consumed revenue, room nights, and other essential metrics based on the Travel Agency Profile."),
